Q089. Generate valid parentheses for n pairs.
✎  SIMPLE ANSWER
Add an opening bracket while fewer than n are used, and a closing bracket only while fewer closes
than opens are used. These constraints ensure every prefix remains valid.
SKETCH THE PATTERN
