💡 Prefix validity prunes invalid sequences before generating their full strings.
⏱ TIME & SPACE
Time/output O(n*C_n), where C_n is Catalan number;
auxiliary space O(n).
⚠ INTERVIEW PITFALL
n=0 returns one empty sequence, not zero solutions.
