How would you count solutions without enumerating them?
Use the Catalan recurrence C0=1 and Cn=sum(Ci*C(n-1-i)) over splits of the first matching pair. Dynamic
programming computes counts without generating every parenthesis string; BigInteger avoids overflow for
large n.
