VERIFICATION AND LIMITS
Inject StringRedisTemplate through a constructor. Validate tenant/key inputs for the real
application. Verify the key bytes, value and positive PTTL. Test overwrite with and without a
Duration. A timeout may mean the SET already happened. A separate SET and EXPIRE would
have a crash gap this operation avoids.
